{"obsah":"<p>This year's first weekend with several events – there'll be more of those this year. On a rainy Saturday we held a slightly reduced Bikeskills camp for men, which had to be interrupted in the afternoon because the riders were soaked – even waterproof jackets couldn't take any more water. Sunday turned out much better, and a bigger group of women enjoyed the sunshine. We rode a few new spots in the area and the progress was very decent. Just before the end of the camp, Vlasta, the only male disturbing element, broke away and set off with Lukáš Valný and Matouš Balík for a big event by the Miskovice lookout tower.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>More than a thousand people came to celebrate witch-burning night, enjoy the competitions and concerts and check out our team's new obstacle setup. Thanks for the cooperation, and to Aleš Matoušek for co-hosting and DJing the whole event.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F5e621b6f-7548-496c-ab98-ee9790baf96b.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F5e621b6f-7548-496c-ab98-ee9790baf96b.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-234148\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230430_170343.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230430_170343.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-234169\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fu